questiontext.text:
Given the class

```cpp
struct Vector
{
    int x, y;
};
```

Write the copy and addition operators for the `Vector` class. Addition is performed according to the rules of vector addition in the plane.

question.answerpreload:
struct Vector
{
    int x, y;
};

question.answer:
struct Vector
{
    int x, y;

    Vector operator=(const Vector &other)
    {
        x = other.x;
        y = other.y;
        return *this;
    }
};

Vector operator+(const Vector &left, const Vector & right) {
    Vector result;
    result.x = left.x + right.x;
    result.y = left.y + right.y;
    return result;
}

testcode.text:
