Given the class

```cpp
class Point 
{
    int x, y;
public:
    int X() const { return x; }
    int Y() const { return y; }
};
```

Write the default, copy, and parameterized constructors for the `Point` class. Define the copy operator for this class.

question.answerpreload:
class Point 
{
    int x, y;
public:
    int X() const { return x; }
    int Y() const { return y; }
};

question.answer:
class Point 
{
    int x, y;
public:
    Point(int a = 0, int b = 0): x(a), y(b) {}
    Point(const Point& p): x(p.x), y(p.y) {}

    Point operator = (const Point& other) {
        x = other.x;
        y = other.y;
        return *this;
    }
    int X() const { return x; }
    int Y() const { return y; }
};

testcode.text:
